      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Some dates of Polish history. *Wojna*, the Second World War, began in 1939. In 1944 Warsaw rose against the German army, *Powstanie Warszawskie*, and many people *zginęli*, were killed. In 1980 the workers of *Stocznia Gdańska*, the shipyard in *Gdańsk*, started *Solidarność*, and in 1989 *komunizm upadł*: communism fell."
      }
    }
